<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales rose 2.7 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales rose 2.7 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales rose 2.7 percent in July, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	   July 96     year to date</p>
<p>    Retail sales		    +2.7	  -0.3</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores +1.8	  +1.6</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     +6.9	  -2.4</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
